# Smoke test: Multi-Scene Animation Demo
# Validates that Scene A (timed event -> animation round trips) and
# Scene B (repeating timer + independent loop animation) both reach
# their milestones within the 5-second window.
# Scene A needs >= 2 round trips (~3.6 s at 0.8 s/leg + 1 s start delay).
# Scene B needs >= 4 timer fires (~2.0 s at 0.5 s interval)
#          and >= 2 animation cycles (~1.2 s at 0.6 s/cycle).
wait startup
wait 5s
exit
